    - {fileID: 1567605089}
    taskObjective: Briarwing has been shedding all over the dunes west of camp. Follow its trail and pick up what it dropped.
    taskLabel: Trail followed
    huntObjective: Briarwing, the thorn wyvern, roosts in the Wreck Field, west of camp. Go and find it.
    fightObjective: Defeat Briarwing. Dodge through its swipes, shoot its glowing throat while it barrages, and get out of its shadow when it climbs.
  - title: Burning Rubber
    boss: {fileID: 2080808974}
    trophyId: burnout_thorns
    where: the Scorch Raceway in the Mesa Pass, east of camp
    tasks:
    - {fileID: 1209975583}
    - {fileID: 1404880506}
    - {fileID: 767041242}
    taskObjective: Cindermaw set the dunes alight on its way east. Smother its fires with sand.
    taskLabel: Fires out
    huntObjective: Cindermaw, the ash drake, is tearing round the Scorch Raceway in the Mesa Pass, east of camp. Go and stop it.
    fightObjective: Defeat Cindermaw. Dodge late when its thruster flares, watch the smoke for the glow, and shoot the thruster.
  - title: Oil and Trouble
    boss: {fileID: 540920506}
    trophyId: sludge_stinger
    where: its fuel sump, north-west of camp
    tasks:
    - {fileID: 1599031225}
    - {fileID: 1500458310}
    - {fileID: 1939531419}
    taskObjective: Seal the three leaking fuel lines round Pitchclaw's sump, north-west of camp. That will bring it out.
    taskLabel: Leaks sealed
    huntObjective: Pitchclaw has crawled out of the sump!
    fightObjective: Defeat Pitchclaw. Get out of its fuel when its claws spark; a charged shot to its fuel tank staggers it.
